{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928180/extras/7b5619c09beac77d1de0694448192761.avif?t=1759422382\" width=625 height=87 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>I like trains...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you already dreamed of managing a railway network? Optimizing train paths, transporting passengers and goods around the world?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Logistik</strong>\u00a0is here for you! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lay tracks between stations, plan routes, organize train schedules, and start enjoying your role as a network manager and railroad company owner!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rail network management<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928180/extras/aa0b8e4a5000a0347e582f45c2faff7c.poster.avif?t=1759422382\" width=1170 height=770 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928180/extras/aa0b8e4a5000a0347e582f45c2faff7c.webm?t=1759422382\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928180/extras/aa0b8e4a5000a0347e582f45c2faff7c.mp4?t=1759422382\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lay tracks between stations and optimize building costs when building in open fields, or on more difficult places such as rivers, forests, or even inside cities!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Route planification</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan and optimize routes to fulfill transport demands. Make people happy by carrying them around the map and transporting their favorite goods close to home!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Compete against other players on the current challenge map</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the same map as the other players and see if you can score more point than them, then compare your scores on a global leaderboard!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage your railway network on some real-life maps</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you want to try creating your own rail network in your favorite country, or even on the whole European continent ? There's a map for you to do that!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3928180?t=1759422382","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928180/446fe50c8e9350a0f061bd16c5ada62ead23debc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759422382","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928180/a1afa0c3abcaf51f14745c369776948eb1a1af74/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759422382","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928180/a1afa0c3abcaf51f14745c369776948eb1a1af74/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759422382","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928180/extras/7b5619c09beac77d1de0694448192761.avif?t=1759422382\" width=625 height=87 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_parag